<title>USA: Ampex wins $8 mln from Mitsubishi.</title>
<headline>Ampex wins $8 mln from Mitsubishi.</headline>
<dateline>WILLMINGTON, Del. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A federal court jury Thursday awarded Ampex Corp $8 million in its patent infringement suit against Mitsubishi Electric Corp, according to a legal source.</p>
<p>Ampex alleged that Mitsubishi's picture-in-a-picture feature infringed an Ampex patent.</p>
<p>The evidence portion of the eight day trial before Roderick McKelvie of the U.S. District Court in Delaware ended Wednesday.</p>
<p>The nine member jury did not find willful infringement.</p>
<p>((--Rita Farrell (212) 859-1610))</p>
